# Export output. Both folder names are derived from the stem typed in the save
# dialog, not fixed, so these match the suffix the writers append rather than any
# one case: saveBlockMeshCase makes <stem>_case, saveSolutionNpy <stem>_solution.
# A blockMesh run then fills _case with constant/polyMesh and time dirs.
*_case/
*_solution/
